{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39829","headline":"玉仙道中 · 殷文圭","name":"玉仙道中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓴鲈方美别吴江，笔阵诗魔两未降。\n山势北蟠龙偃蹇，泉声东漱玉琤瑽。\n古陂狐兔穿蛮塚，破寺荆榛拥佛幢。\n信马冷吟迷路处，隔溪烟雨吠村厖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39829.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39829","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}